WEBVTT

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.860
There it is.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.560
And I have one more request.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.050
Sure.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.720
Get Shoichi Kusanagi.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.270
He’s inside Den City 
courtyard's hot dog wagon.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.680
That's definitely Shoichi Kusanagi.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.390
Bohman and Soulburner.

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:51.360
God rolls the die.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.680
Judgment Dice!

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:01.640
I rolled Water Attribute.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:06.710
So Paradox Hydradrive Atlas 
becomes Water Attribute.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:11.380
Atlas’s additional effect!

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.050
Once per turn, I roll a die.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:18.100
I Special Summon a Hydradrive 
Link Monster next to its link...

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:23.360
...from the Extra Deck with Link 
Markers equal to what I rolled.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.810
Judgment Dice!

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.840
I rolled a 4!

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:33.470
So I Special Summon a Link 4 monster.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:37.900
Appear, Rousing Hydradrive Monarch!

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:45.780
When it's Special Summoned 
from the Extra Deck...

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:48.480
...I place four Hydradrive Counters on it.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:59.970
Due to Atlas’s effect, the monster next to 
its link become the same Attribute as Atlas.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:06.510
Using Fire Attribute isn't the only 
way to deal with a fire duelist.

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:14.260
The Water Attribute I 
acquired is perfect for you.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:37.290
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:44.080
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:51.400
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:57.970
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:04.720
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:11.950
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:18.660
I want to share your pain

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:57.880
Since he no longer has a Fire monster, he 
avoided Salamangreat Shrine’s effect.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:58.870
And...

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:03.420
God rolls the dice for a third time.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.830
Rousing Hydradrive Monarch’s effect!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.830
I remove one Hydradrive 
Counter to roll a die.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:17.300
I send all your monsters with the 
Attribute I roll to the graveyard.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:20.970
And you take 500 damage for each one!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.060
Judgment Dice!

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.950
I rolled Fire Attribute!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:35.420
Heatleo goes to the graveyard, 
and you take 500 damage!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.380
This is bad!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.560
Soulburner’s field is empty!

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.360
Battle!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.870
Rousing Hydradrive Monarch 
attacks you directly!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.210
Are you okay, Soulburner?

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.150
What was that shock?

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:12.520
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.960
Damn!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.980
That was close!  3000 damage 
from a single strike!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.410
Hey, wake up already!

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.500
Soulburner's in a pinch!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:24.610
Here I go!

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:27.290
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:28.870
Soulburner.

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:34.970
A monster that uses luck may 
seem like a reckless strategy.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.550
But this is calculated randomness.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.580
What do you mean?

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:44.020
Unlike humans, AIs don't have insight.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:47.990
So he's using luck to compensate.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.730
He can suddenly do that?

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:55.200
Bohman is an excellent AI.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:59.130
But dice create a huge 
number of duel patterns.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.940
Instantly calculating them 
is nearly impossible.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:06.080
He can't be that excellent.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:10.880
He might be using a trick, 
but now’s not the time!

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.790
I’ll make luck my ally too!

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:19.790
By showing you the Salamangreat Sanctuary 
in my hand, Shrine's effect activates!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:25.330
I return my entire hand to my deck, 
and I draw the same number of cards!

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:32.060
From my hand, I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Will of the Salamangreat!

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:35.130
I Special Summon a Salamangreat 
from my graveyard!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:37.410
Come, Heatleo!

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:43.170
I use Rousing Hydradrive Monarch’s effect!

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.380
I knew he'd used it!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.390
This is bad.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:53.320
If he rolls a Fire, I lose.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.530
I rolled Water.

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:00.580
He missed.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.170
You barely escaped defeat.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:07.460
Yeah.  It seems you failed.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.180
I'm going to end this quick!

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.610
I use Salamangreat Shrine’s effect.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.810
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:19.350
Be reborn, Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:27.860
When it’s Link Summoned, I return a card 
in your Spell & Trap Zone to your deck!

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.560
Which one…

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:35.300
Your odds of success are 1 in 2.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:39.500
This choice may determine who wins and loses.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.540
Okay, this one!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:47.000
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Card of Pandora!

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.040
What?

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:56.320
When your effect activates, the 
target switches to this card.

00:07:56.320 --> 00:08:00.530
Then I draw two cards!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:05.040
So whichever we chose, the 
result would've been the same.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.560
Not bad.

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:12.500
The Reincarnation Link Summoned 
Heatleo's effect activates!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:17.480
Rousing Hydradrive Monarch’s ATK become 
the same as Mole in the graveyard!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.890
Flame Possession!

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:24.450
What?

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:27.170
Yeah!  Go, Soulburner!

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.440
Hurry up and wake up!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.610
You’ll miss the best part!

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:36.860
Wake up, Yusaku.

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.900
Let me sleep a little longer.

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:40.920
I said wake up.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:44.700
I've had it with everything.  I’m tired.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:45.860
Leave me alone.

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:47.860
Wake up, Yusaku.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:51.050
There’s something you still need to do.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.930
What I need to do?

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:56.050
Yes.  It’s my final request.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.450
You’re finally awake, Playmaker!

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.660
Yeah.  Kusanagi woke me up.

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:10.690
Soulburner is dueling?

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.060
Yeah!  Against Bohman!

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.550
Battle!

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:19.520
Heatleo attacks Rousing Hydradrive Monarch!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:24.180
I activate the Continuous Trap, Dice Logic!

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:27.570
I roll a die against an attacking monster.

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:31.080
If it’s an odd number, 
Heatleo’s ATK become 0.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:34.150
If it’s an even number, 
its ATK are doubled.

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:36.420
The odds are 1 in 2.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:40.550
But this turn, since I’m 
using Judgment Dice...

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:46.250
...if I roll a 5 or less, I can 
use a number that’s 1 higher.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:46.860
What?

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:52.240
So other than rolling a 6, the ATK become 0.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.080
What’s up with that?

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:56.370
Judgment Dice!

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:00.580
It’s a 2!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.580
I add 1 to treat it as a 3.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:07.560
Heatleo’s ATK become 0!

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.920
He avoided it!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.450
Is he really calculating the odds of luck-

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:19.180
What’s wrong, Flame?

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:20.890
I-I’m fine.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:25.890
AI's evolution speed is much 
faster than you imagine.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:30.380
It'll quickly spread and 
overtake the human world.

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:35.280
And at its end is the ultimate.  Me.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.280
That’s why you don’t need humans?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.250
Stop pretending to be a god!

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:46.720
You think humans can stay at the top forever?

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.730
You’re even now relying on Flame.

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:51.500
You understand nothing!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:11:00.200
Before I think of Flame as an AI, 
I think of him as a dear friend!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.170
Soulburner…

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:06.120
To tell you the truth, I don’t 
really get what an AI is.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:09.700
But I was able to cheer up, thanks to Flame!

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:13.500
And I’m now here because I met Playmaker!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.840
And that's it!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:18.380
No matter what happens to the 
world, my soul won't change!

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.160
I fight for what I believe in!

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:26.360
You’re finally saying impressive things-

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:30.570
What’s wrong?

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:32.520
Are you okay, Flame?

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:44.820
What?

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.320
You’re Windy!

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:55.990
Windy…  You’re…

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:02.980
I told you I'd curse you, Flame!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:07.920
You didn’t realize I 
resurrected inside you.

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:12.310
The impact from the duel hid 
that I rewrote your program.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.770
So that was your doing.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:18.940
Too late to realize that now!

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:23.720
Stop it!  Get away from Flame!

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.610
Stay calm.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:30.560
You’re nothing compared to Flame.

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:33.560
I've changed my mind.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:37.300
Flame, you gave me quite the hard time.

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:40.300
I’ll pay you back in full.

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:44.340
You can watch your partner get eaten!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.480
Stop it, Windy!

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:50.180
Be quiet!

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.570
Don’t order me around!

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:55.090
Just stay quiet and watch!

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:58.890
Soulburner…

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:03.020
It’s over.  Vanish-

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.720
You…

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:14.510
Where are you getting that strength?

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:25.530
Stop messing around!

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:29.120
I’m not messing around!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.770
Stop it!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.760
Are you okay, Flame?

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.930
Yeah.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:39.820
I can’t believe it.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:43.940
He was close to decimated, but 
he managed to regain control.

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:46.170
Don’t forget.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.170
My name is Flame.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:54.380
Written as "indomitable soul 
dream!"  Pronounced "Flame!"

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.750
Indomitable soul…

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:00.700
Never underestimate the strength of my will!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.720
You always overexert yourself.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.190
For my partner?  Of course.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.430
Flame…

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:14.480
Hey!  What’s wrong?

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:18.400
It seems it's the end for me.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.960
Your end?

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:24.580
Soulburner, I have one final request.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:28.280
Do whatever it takes to defeat Bohman.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:36.990
I was happy that you 
treated me as your equal.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:45.530
To achieve the future we both wanted, 
I’m counting on you... partner...

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.910
Flame!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.880
This is a joke, right?

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:10.000
I apologize that I couldn’t do anything.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:14.590
It doesn't look like this duel can continue.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.790
You don't get to choose.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:23.700
If I quit now, Flame saved me for no reason!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:27.040
Bring it on!  We’re continuing the duel!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:29.540
This is no longer about humans or AIs!

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.970
It’s a fight between me and you!

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.380
Fine.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:38.610
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
Salamangreat Burning Shell!

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:43.850
I negate the effects of a Salamangreat 
in my hand and Special Summon it!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:47.560
Appear, Salamangreat Parro!

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:52.230
Then due to Burning Shell’s 
effect, I Link Summon!

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:56.500
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:02.740
I set Salamangreat Parro and Link 
3 Heatleo in the Link Markers!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.510
Link Summon!

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:12.220
Appear!  Link 4 Salamangreat Pyro Phoenix!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:17.420
Link 4…  So that's the 
power of your friendship.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:22.040
But when I use this method to Link Summon,

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.900
the 
monster can’t activate its effects nor attack this turn.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.600
What are you planning to do?

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:30.610
Burn an even greater flame!

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:34.970
The flame of my and Flame’s souls!

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:39.110
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
Salamangreat Transcendence!

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:45.250
I use one Salamangreat on my field to 
Link Summon a monster with the same name!

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.640
Here we go, Flame!

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:56.790
Phoenix!  Throw yourself in the surging 
flames to awaken your immortal power!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:01.090
Super Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:07.370
Be reborn, Link 4 Salamangreat Pyro Phoenix!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:12.010
Super Reincarnation Link Summon.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:16.080
Watch, Flame.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:21.370
With our new power, I’ll 
make your wish come true!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:27.790
When this monster is Reincarnation Link 
Summoned, all cards on your field are destroyed!

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.800
That won’t happen!

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:39.240
Due to Atlas’s effect, it can’t be 
attacked, and your effects can’t affect it.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.610
What?

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:45.290
And the destroyed Dice 
Logic’s effect activates!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:49.410
I Special Summon a Hydradrive 
Link Monster from the Extra Deck!

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:51.810
Come out, Rousing!

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:59.620
Due to Atlas’s effect, the Rousing Hydradrive 
Monarch next to its link becomes Water Attribute!

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.590
Pyro Phoenix’s effect activates!

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:08.730
You take damage equal to your 
Link Monster's original ATK!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.170
I won’t let you do that!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:15.220
From my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Trap, Judgment Roll!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:21.650
By tributing Hydradrive 
Monarch, you roll a die!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.010
Me?

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:26.020
I accept everything.

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.990
You determine your own fate!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:31.520
Is he serious?

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:33.960
He’s letting Soulburner roll?

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:38.870
Monsters with the Attribute you roll 
have their ATK doubled this turn.

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:41.200
All other monsters become 0.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:47.200
So if I roll a Fire, Pyro 
Phoenix’s ATK will be doubled.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.440
But if I roll anything else…

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:54.910
Your roll will determine the 
humans' and Ignis' future.

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:57.380
Now roll.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.150
Interesting.

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:04.250
I accept this challenge!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.290
The odds are 1 in 6.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:15.730
Flame, give me strength!

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.240
Burning Dice!

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:23.740
He did it!

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:28.220
Pyro Phoenix’s ATK are doubled!

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:33.300
5600 ATK!  Wow!

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:34.050
Yeah.

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:36.090
Go, Soulburner!

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:37.560
Battle!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:41.620
Pyro Phoenix attacks Atlas!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:47.200
Flame, I’ll get revenge for Cyberse World!

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.930
Go!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.940
You won't succeed.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:57.300
From my hand, I activate the 
trap card, Hydradrive Gravity!

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:02.150
I move Pyro Phoenix next to Atlas’s link.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:03.850
What?

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:08.820
And due to Atlas’s effect, Pyro 
Phoenix becomes Water Attribute.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:20.630
Due to Judgment Roll’s 
effect, its ATK become 0!

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:23.870
No way!

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:29.110
And you take damage equal 
to its original ATK.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:34.200
I accept everything.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:38.550
You determine your own fate!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:42.930
Damn…  Back then…

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:48.450
Damn!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:58.340
Damn.  I’m going to lose.

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:03.310
Sorry, Flame.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:08.340
I couldn’t keep our promise.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:16.220
Playmaker, I leave the rest to you.

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:33.600
Soulburner…

00:21:35.970 --> 00:21:41.580
Soulburner, you were a good, honest human.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:46.550
But there's no place for you in my future.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:52.520
I'll keep knowledge of your existence 
in the recesses of my memories.

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:58.530
Now I’ve finished my training 
for my battle against Playmaker.

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:01.740
Just wait, Playmaker!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.900
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:26.340
Even denials are obvious

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:27.470
That There This Whichever

00:22:27.470 --> 00:22:29.300
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:30.970
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:32.540
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:33.710
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:40.750
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:43.820
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:44.020 --> 00:22:46.960
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:47.290 --> 00:22:50.020
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:58.600
Let your emotions spill

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:04.740
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:05.140 --> 00:23:10.140
If we're together

00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:13.550
We can seize it

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:47.070
Why did Lightning think the Ignis are 
imperfect, thus requiring him to create Bohman?

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:54.080
He reveals the never-before-known 
truth to Revolver.

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:57.600
The truth was not the truth?

00:23:58.650 --> 00:24:03.660
